d 'ADOUPDATE2': module to temporarily provide ado update functionality	
d
d  Pending update of the official Stata ado command, this package
d allows you to use ado2 update and ado2 update, update commands.
d There is no help file. 
d
d KW: package management
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
